Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato. 24 TL
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.87,0:00:06.67,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,The confetti…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.15,0:00:09.66,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,...is being accepted.{Ori: gathering.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.53,0:00:19.08,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san’s wish has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.31,0:00:23.10,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,But the contract cannot be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.40,0:00:26.60,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,She’ll go to the place she wished for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.30,0:00:32.05,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn’t this more like a curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:35.36,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.57,0:00:40.37,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,I have to go to the place I belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.62,0:00:44.03,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.74,0:00:46.10,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait…!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{opening}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,"The Day That Comes Tomorrow…"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.08,0:03:15.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.61,0:03:17.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.18,0:03:19.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Mama told us to clean out the mattress.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.99,0:03:20.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Mattress?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.29,0:03:25.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why was there a mattress in an empty room?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.95,0:03:28.94,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.94,0:03:31.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san carried it for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.41,0:03:35.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu-kun, is your arm all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.15,0:03:36.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.31,0:03:38.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s been a full month, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.25,0:03:40.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.79,0:03:42.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, what’s that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.72,0:03:46.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I was thinking of finding a new tenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.39,0:03:50.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That room’s been empty even before Kiyokazu-kun came,{Ori: That room’s been empty ever since Kiyokazu-kun came,}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.66,0:03:53.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,so it must be pretty lonely without anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.06,0:03:55.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.01,0:03:59.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose-san, I’ll ventilate the room from time to time,{Ori: Chitose-san, I’ll bring in some ventilation in the room once in a while.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.65,0:04:02.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,so could you leave it unoccupied for a while?{Ori: Do you think you could leave it unoccupied for a while?}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.48,0:04:04.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.24,0:04:08.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.33,0:04:12.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry... for saying something weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.71,0:04:21.88,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu, it’s been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.88,0:04:26.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it true that you didn’t go to the professor’s seminar?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.28,0:04:27.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.75,0:04:30.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Weren’t you trying to become a lawyer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.97,0:04:34.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I heard you haven’t even been taking notes lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.51,0:04:35.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.40,0:04:38.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.23,0:04:44.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Something’s off about you. It's as if you’ve lost your drive or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.47,0:04:45.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.87,0:04:47.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.30,0:04:50.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You did lose something pretty important.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.27,0:04:56.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s been three months now, eh…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.86,0:04:59.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It's too bad about that preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.29,0:05:03.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh… that isn’t bothering me that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.89,0:05:06.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s just…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.22,0:05:16.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Just…?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.14,0:05:19.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.20,0:05:22.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.27,0:05:29.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.99,0:05:47.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{kids}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.69,0:05:51.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The kids were all worried about Yomogi Preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.72,0:05:53.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We all came to see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.73,0:06:04.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-kun, I’m thinking of re-establishing Yomogi Preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.60,0:06:11.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okiura said that he’d do all he could to help this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.47,0:06:15.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.53,0:06:16.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.82,0:06:18.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-kun, you hang in there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.80,0:06:19.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.13,0:06:24.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I heard you were moping around at your school.{Ori: I heard you weren’t doing so well in school lately.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.27,0:06:27.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Doumoto, that bastard…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.99,0:06:33.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Once we’re ready, let’s go\Non a field trip together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.58,0:06:36.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, with everyone…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.58,0:06:38.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,150)}Everyone…?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.63,0:06:45.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, a field trip with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.21,0:06:46.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, a field trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.92,0:06:48.38,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.38,0:06:50.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, where should we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.01,0:06:51.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to go, too! {Keeper: orig line "Marina wants to go too!"}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.84,0:06:54.68,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s right, let’s all go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.68,0:06:56.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, Fujimoto-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.93,0:06:58.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.93,0:07:01.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yay, everyone together!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.82,0:07:51.28,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,400)}Fujimoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.28,0:07:53.24,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,400)}What a bully.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.61,0:07:55.45,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,500)}Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.45,0:07:58.37,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,1000)}I’ll work hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.54,0:08:07.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.59,0:08:16.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.73,0:09:10.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.48,0:09:15.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,How come no one remembers her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.29,0:09:30.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um…!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.25,0:09:33.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.51,0:09:43.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like you’re not here to deliver the paper today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.48,0:09:49.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I remember her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.69,0:09:54.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No one else remembers her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.86,0:09:57.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So why do you…?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.49,0:10:02.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that what you wanted to ask about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.87,0:10:04.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.12,0:10:09.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Please tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.08,0:10:16.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,When she disappeared, she said “I have to go to the place I belong,” right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.13,0:10:18.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.84,0:10:23.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you truly want to know,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.10,0:10:27.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,please, don’t be shocked about what you’re about to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.39,0:10:30.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.36,0:10:33.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.19,0:10:45.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Long ago, she lost her life due to another unfortunate incident in the human world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.12,0:10:48.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Lost her life?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:52.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san’s wish was…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.71,0:10:59.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,To cross over time and be reborn so that she could be with the one she loves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.84,0:11:03.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That was Kobato-san’s wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.06,0:11:08.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And in order to grant that wish,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.35,0:11:13.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,she accepted a trial and was\Nallowed to come to this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.40,0:11:21.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Within those four seasons,\Nwhile having a transient soul…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.70,0:11:26.08,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then… she’s already there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.45,0:11:28.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.87,0:11:35.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Shuichiro-san and I also bid many farewells
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.54,0:11:38.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,during these long months and years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.63,0:11:41.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Shuichiro, that doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.51,0:11:42.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.09,0:11:46.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But every time Shuichiro-san is reborn…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.35,0:11:50.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, every time he is reborn,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.93,0:11:54.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,our hearts pull towards each other and we reunite.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.11,0:11:58.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if he’s lost the memories of his previous life…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.32,0:12:03.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He has the same soul, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.99,0:12:11.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as his soul continues to exist, we’ll always continue on.{As long as his soul continues to exist, he’ll always come back…}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.96,0:12:13.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Surely…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,19 eyecatch}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{sign}Fukida Lawyer Office
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.94,0:12:41.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If the construction machinery was\Nseized, we wouldn’t know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.15,0:12:43.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s all thanks to you, Fukida-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.53,0:12:45.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s great news.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.16,0:12:46.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Please do your best from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.99,0:12:49.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.83,0:12:51.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Fujimoto-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.95,0:12:52.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.95,0:12:54.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You don’t have to worry about the rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.79,0:12:57.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,so read the documents on the desk for me. {Keeper: that doesnt’ really fit the next line? TLC?}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.38,0:13:01.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a bit far away, so I’ve got a request for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.05,0:13:01.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.96,0:13:04.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s about an inheritance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.51,0:13:06.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei, who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.18,0:13:09.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Yamauchi, it’s your first time meeting him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.43,0:13:13.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This is his fourth year in this office.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.89,0:13:17.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, this is Fukida’s office.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.89,0:13:18.56,KO,,0000,0000,0000,,He’s still young, but he really has it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.44,0:13:23.15,KO,,0000,0000,0000,,My, if only my son was like that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.56,0:13:22.19,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-kun, it’s secretary\NHattori from the courthouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.19,0:13:23.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.11,0:13:29.62,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,The client passed away the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.70,0:13:33.33,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,The son and his wife also passed away,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.33,0:13:39.79,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,so two years ago, they wrote a will to\Ngive their inheritance to the grandchild.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.79,0:13:44.59,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,But according to the real estate papers, they’re an old lineage,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.59,0:13:48.51,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,and the boundaries of the land are unclear as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.01,0:13:50.35,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.35,0:13:52.97,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll go investigate the location tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.38,0:17:19.05,Insert Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fad(200,200)}…{\k66}sa{\k105}ku {\k43}ha{\k114}na
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.05,0:17:24.85,Insert Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fad(200,200)}{\k67}na{\k57}tsu {\k55}hi{\k53}ro{\k57}ga{\k49}ru {\k109}so{\k58}ra {\k78}yo
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.35,0:17:28.35,Insert Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fad(200,200)}{\k108}ko{\k70}ko{\k107}ro {\k60}no…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.38,0:17:19.05,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}The flowers that bloom in the spring
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.05,0:17:24.85,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}The spacious summer skies
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.35,0:17:28.35,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Engraves and glistens
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.40,0:17:33.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re from the lawyer’s office?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.78,0:17:35.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.24,0:17:38.70,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,300)}Same here…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.99,0:17:41.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.37,0:17:48.37,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if he’s lost the memories of his previous life…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.75,0:17:49.83,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.46,0:17:52.09,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.21,0:17:56.09,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.30,0:17:59.64,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,...is my important person.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.68,0:18:02.22,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,Up until now…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.10,0:18:05.14,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,And from now on…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.14,0:18:06.39,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,400)}Always…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.35,0:18:09.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Piano…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.98,0:18:14.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re good at playing the piano.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.40,0:18:17.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for playing without asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.90,0:18:21.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I know that song as well for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.99,0:18:23.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn’t that odd? {Keeper: orig line "How mysterious."}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.99,0:18:25.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.58,0:18:29.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a song someone important to me sang long ago…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.33,0:18:32.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ve been looking for that person since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.92,0:18:35.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.67,0:18:37.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I hope you find that person.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.55,0:18:41.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.18,0:18:46.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, is it all right if I\Ninspect the inside of the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.72,0:18:47.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.98,0:18:53.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.36,0:18:58.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,All that’s left is to process the inheritance back at the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.65,0:19:01.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.95,0:19:05.91,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And this… I need to give it back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.91,0:19:06.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.29,0:19:12.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Confetti?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.04,0:19:16.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Will you sing that song one last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.42,0:19:19.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.97,0:20:48.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.56,0:20:56.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s right…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.94,0:21:02.94,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The place I wanted to go…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:07.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,To be beside my most important person…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.24,0:21:17.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If we were to meet again, I told\Nmyself to say it with a smile this time…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.25,0:21:22.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m… so hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.46,0:21:24.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.22,0:21:29.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.77,0:21:34.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You made me wait so many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.48,0:21:37.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You really overslept.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.15,0:21:44.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san!
