Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.77,0:19:41.70,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}The flowers that bloom in the spring
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.28,0:19:48.08,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}The spacious summer skies
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.08,0:19:54.96,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Engraves and glistens
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.88,0:20:02.09,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Inside my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.68,0:20:08.72,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Even in the rain that falls in the morning
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.47,0:20:15.77,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}And the day that I shut my window
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.40,0:20:22.28,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}My heart is overflowing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.11,0:20:27.58,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Because the light is shining above the clouds
