Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.24,0:21:54.75,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Happiness and sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.75,0:22:01.38,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I embrace them all and continue to walk
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.38,0:22:08.22,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Take my hand along with your hand
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.22,0:22:15.02,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,600)}And make a powerful bond
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,58}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.72,0:22:56.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, that’s how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.43,0:22:58.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Even though that idiot fulfilled his mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.93,0:23:02.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,he decided to watch over\Nthat girl in the human world,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.31,0:23:07.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,so we’re still here making baumkuchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.69,0:23:08.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.69,0:23:11.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s yummy, baumkuchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.37,0:23:15.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.12,0:23:20.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I deserve 100 points.
