Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.79,0:22:40.67,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}in the treetops at the waterfront
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.38,0:22:47.26,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}In the depths of the earth
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.67,0:22:53.93,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}lies unlimited kindness
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.43,0:23:00.48,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Each time the night comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.02,0:23:07.07,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}we’ll offer a prayer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.57,0:23:13.62,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}We’ll quietly greet
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.16,0:23:20.46,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}the next day
