Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.46,0:23:28.09,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Please guide me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.09,0:23:34.55,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}O voice from the great distance
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.55,0:23:38.43,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}It seems like it’s smiling
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.43,0:23:41.52,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}It seems like it’s singing
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.52,0:23:47.65,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}The sound of the echoing breeze
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.65,0:23:54.16,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Happiness and sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.16,0:24:00.83,English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I embrace them all and continue to walk
